{"name": "Toy Smash Kaboom!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Our Official <strong>Discord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(You can access Discord link from the panel on the right.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"145\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"647\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/9cd90ef45bc52840f1b1ca7de026bea8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dusty corner of memory, the toy room stirs once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken forgotten childhood toys and fuse them within the small table to craft your own kaboom legion \u2014 from ground collisions to aerial strikes and magical blasts. Through each tabletop battle, fragments of your long-lost childhood return\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1039\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/a653b63d714b86955e7dee9864fe0e53.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/ab089feb23e65783cd22fd7da4aeeeee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span>Arrange, Combine, and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of toy arrangement on your tabletop! Every toy slot is a strategic decision. Plan your layout, combine rare units, and arrange them wisely to unlock your build\u2019s full potential!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/0cd5c17d1d9144065316e884b3b64a8a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own tactical system from over 400 strategic toys!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ summons to clash in tabletop battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ traps and class abilities to outsmart your opponents and shift momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">250+ magic items and weapons to power up your strategy and unleash devastating combos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/7673602b1e8ba7e8d4f95a0d04e740f9.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/6e20767586a723ddd9db20c28e3b95fe.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span>Collisions &amp; Knockback</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon toys into head-to-head battles where it\u2019s not just about stats\u2014brave charges and knockback strikes can send enemies flying, turning the tide in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/46c587976bc0ceb868280986daf56704.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set traps across the table to break enemy momentum and open up opportunities to strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/17395743d0ca2baf2f73de9b107b418a.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/27dda68a2e9077b32cda1e362120cfee.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in asynchronous PvP where your legion clashes with global builds in tactical showdowns. Analyze, adapt, and optimize your strategy in mirror matches and rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick Your Toy Captain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hero brings a unique toy arsenal and exclusive class abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Doll Chef: A kitchen defense expert who controls space and fortifies positions, perfect for defensive-minded players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dr. Hamster: Commander of Hamster Legion that leads a swarm of tiny units to overwhelm enemies with relentless numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puppet Musician: A rhythm master who speeds up allies and disrupts foes, setting the tempo of every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naughty\u00a0Andy:\u00a0Summoner\u00a0of\u00a0nightmares\u00a0\u2014\u00a0ghosts,\u00a0skeletons,\u00a0reapers,\u00a0and\u00a0dark\u00a0curses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frost\u00a0Hunter:\u00a0Rule\u00a0the\u00a0frozen\u00a0land,\u00a0command\u00a0wild\u00a0beasts,\u00a0and\u00a0unleash\u00a0the\u00a0power\u00a0of\u00a0water\u00a0magic!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/1e63d83ac7ce2509e89327d1cd31dc84.mp4?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn Your Friends into Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your Steam friends into fully armed \"Game Buddy\", customize them with all kinds of weapons and attributes, then rally them into your toy army to charge into battle for friendship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1039\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/94db0d27bbaadb2b4039fd821e3fd86f.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/23d4e0504e4ee58cbba2996543e9fd46.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span>Unveil Toy Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock achievements, hero skins, and the toys\u2019 hidden memories through a pop-up storybook. Within its dusty pages, the long-lost tales of Fred and his childhood friends quietly come back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.poster.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"1038\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/71aa0f8faa68e007cfa7f83d91d7f5d8.webm?t=1784282568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras_big/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/extras/276368be29482474f2f364cca8aaf214.avif?t=1784282568\" width=\"800\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Toy mayhem unleashed! Arrange, combine, and craft the wildest toy army inside your desk, then crash into chaotic cartoon brawls across the tabletop!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573070/ebf7c1340d0d6d55fa3efd93e8e20d645cfd6073/header.jpg?t=1784282568", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "PvP", "Multiplayer", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Anime"], "developers": "Free Particle", "publishers": "Free Particle", "release_date": "Dec 3, 2025", "price": "$13.99", "appid": "3573070", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 June 2025 - Request Access\n\n5 August 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uOg-s1iB5Q8", "first_seen": 1749679200.0, "review_rank": 1575}